# Work RAM $000C-$03F4 cleared ($81:9639, LowRamClear): nothing in the
# game calls it, so no screen runs it. A unit call by JSL on the first
# level's state (M and X 8-bit, DB $80), with S at $1EFF: every stack the
# game uses lies in the range it clears, and the call's own return must
# not. (The machine is put back after the call.)
load build/aladdin/states/level1.state
wait 10
call 819639 long db=80 p=30 s=1EFF
